[{"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.64.0-nightly.20261003.gfb972b2f8", "id": 402261904, "tag_name": "v0.64.0-nightly.20261003.gfb972b2f8", "name": "Release v0.64.0-nightly.20261003.gfb972b2f8", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-03T01:21:03Z", "published_at": "2026-10-03T01:29:14Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): ensure Enter and Spacebar reliably confirm selection list options by @ugorla-dev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29502\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.64.0-nightly.20261002.gc9096a847...v0.64.0-nightly.20261003.gfb972b2f8"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.64.0-nightly.20261002.gc9096a847", "id": 401476363, "tag_name": "v0.64.0-nightly.20261002.gc9096a847", "name": "Release v0.64.0-nightly.20261002.gc9096a847", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-02T01:25:48Z", "published_at": "2026-10-02T01:33:21Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): implement append-only delta patching and bounded history windowing in ChatRecordingService by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29568\n* fix(cli): persist state atomically and recover from backup on corruption by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29558\n* fix(cli): ensure Ctrl+C emergency abort reaches cancellation handler during active operations by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29586\n* fix(cli): resolve @file:line references and prevent ghost text wrap hang by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29581\n* fix(ui): ensure Windows ConPTY forwards IME cursor position by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29560\n* fix(cli): retry directory removal on Windows locking errors during extension updates by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29540\n* fix(acp): resolve session by exact id and handle listener cleanup on session failure by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29580\n* fix(cli): preserve scroll position and p"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.64.0-nightly.20261001.gc6bccb7ec", "id": 400578173, "tag_name": "v0.64.0-nightly.20261001.gc6bccb7ec", "name": "Release v0.64.0-nightly.20261001.gc6bccb7ec", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-10-01T01:26:41Z", "published_at": "2026-10-01T01:34:16Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): prevent CPU hang and quote swallowing on @ within code (#29434) by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29557\n* fix(core): serialize file tool operations and make writes atomic (#29078) by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29499\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.64.0-nightly.20260930.g38700b4b3...v0.64.0-nightly.20261001.gc6bccb7ec"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.64.0-nightly.20260930.g38700b4b3", "id": 399647199, "tag_name": "v0.64.0-nightly.20260930.g38700b4b3", "name": "Release v0.64.0-nightly.20260930.g38700b4b3", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-30T01:26:48Z", "published_at": "2026-09-30T01:33:55Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): enable autonomous plan execution in non-interactive mode by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29539\n* fix(core): disable truncation when maxChars <= 0 in formatTruncatedToolOutput by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29542\n* refactor(a2a-server): implement V1 to V2 settings migration logic by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29450\n* fix(acp): bridge PromptResponse.usage and emit usage_update notifications (#29389) by @elberthc-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29549\n* Changelog for v0.63.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29565\n* fix(cli): propagate resolved folder trust state in headless mode (#29031) by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29528\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.64.0-nightly.20260929.gd75234cae by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29567\n\n## New Contributors\n* @elberthc-byte made their first contribution in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29549\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://git"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.63.0-preview.0", "id": 399522978, "tag_name": "v0.63.0-preview.0", "name": "Release v0.63.0-preview.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-29T20:48:14Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T20:58:07Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): display retry progress indicator during connection recovery (#28340) by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29468\n* Changelog for v0.61.0-preview.1 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29469\n* Changelog for v0.61.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29472\n* fix(cli): distinguish missing MCP enablement config from malformed JSON by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29446\n* fix(cli): restore paused stdin after capability detection by @ugorla-dev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29487\n* fix(core): bound tool output size and optimize memory lifecycle in long-running agent loops by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29451\n* fix(core): remove invalid diff.external override by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29467\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.63.0-nightly.20260923.gf50ba8608 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29471\n* Changelog for v0.62.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/go"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.63.0-nightly.20260929.gfe6350238", "id": 398747749, "tag_name": "v0.63.0-nightly.20260929.gfe6350238", "name": "Release v0.63.0-nightly.20260929.gfe6350238", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-29T01:13:57Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T01:19:35Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(auth): prevent infinite auth loop from file contention, headless keyring, and supervisor state drops (#28341) by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29448\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.63.0-nightly.20260928.g2fe7c2d3f...v0.63.0-nightly.20260929.gfe6350238"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0", "id": 399534915, "tag_name": "v0.62.0", "name": "Release v0.62.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-29T21:09:52Z", "published_at": "2026-09-29T21:17:07Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(a2a-server): add early return on unsupported store in tasks metadata endpoint by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29334\n* Changelog for v0.61.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29344\n* Changelog for v0.60.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29345\n* fix(core,acp): format MCP tool call titles as structured signatures and segregate explanations by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29341\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.62.0-nightly.20260915.gae28844fb by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29346\n* fix(core): retain oauth refresh token on refresh and make credential deletion idempotent by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29339\n* fix(ui): guard against negative layout dimensions in border rendering by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29347\n* test(integration): deflake run_shell_command and file-system-interactive tests by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29185"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.63.0-nightly.20260928.g2fe7c2d3f", "id": 397892751, "tag_name": "v0.63.0-nightly.20260928.g2fe7c2d3f", "name": "Release v0.63.0-nightly.20260928.g2fe7c2d3f", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-28T01:28:21Z", "published_at": "2026-09-28T01:42:38Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.63.0-nightly.20260926.g2fe7c2d3f...v0.63.0-nightly.20260928.g2fe7c2d3f"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.63.0-nightly.20260926.g2fe7c2d3f", "id": 397017089, "tag_name": "v0.63.0-nightly.20260926.g2fe7c2d3f", "name": "Release v0.63.0-nightly.20260926.g2fe7c2d3f", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-26T01:14:19Z", "published_at": "2026-09-26T01:20:07Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): remove invalid diff.external override by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29467\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.63.0-nightly.20260923.gf50ba8608 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29471\n* Changelog for v0.62.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29470\n* fix(core): clean up temporary directory when background shell execution exits by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29437\n* fix(acp): resolve session before config initialization and avoid same-minute filename collisions by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29463\n* fix(core): align policy redirection gates, path validation, and workflow parsing by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29506\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260925.gbedef96ef...v0.63.0-nightly.20260926.g2fe7c2d3f"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260925.gbedef96ef", "id": 396203970, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260925.gbedef96ef", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260925.gbedef96ef", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-25T01:17:54Z", "published_at": "2026-09-25T01:23:57Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* Changelog for v0.61.0-preview.1 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29469\n* Changelog for v0.61.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29472\n* fix(cli): distinguish missing MCP enablement config from malformed JSON by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29446\n* fix(cli): restore paused stdin after capability detection by @ugorla-dev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29487\n* fix(core): bound tool output size and optimize memory lifecycle in long-running agent loops by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29451\n\n## New Contributors\n* @ugorla-dev made their first contribution in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29487\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260924.g8e70c862f...v0.62.0-nightly.20260925.gbedef96ef"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260924.g8e70c862f", "id": 395218707, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260924.g8e70c862f", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260924.g8e70c862f", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-24T01:18:56Z", "published_at": "2026-09-24T01:25:37Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* Check for vsc integration test presence when attempting to run. by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29462\n* fix(cli): display retry progress indicator during connection recovery (#28340) by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29468\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260923.g62364cb20...v0.62.0-nightly.20260924.g8e70c862f"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-preview.0", "id": 395148982, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-preview.0", "name": "Release v0.62.0-preview.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-23T23:41:04Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T23:47:50Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(a2a-server): add early return on unsupported store in tasks metadata endpoint by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29334\n* Changelog for v0.61.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29344\n* Changelog for v0.60.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29345\n* fix(core,acp): format MCP tool call titles as structured signatures and segregate explanations by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29341\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.62.0-nightly.20260915.gae28844fb by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29346\n* fix(core): retain oauth refresh token on refresh and make credential deletion idempotent by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29339\n* fix(ui): guard against negative layout dimensions in border rendering by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29347\n* test(integration): deflake run_shell_command and file-system-interactive tests by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29185"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260923.g62364cb20", "id": 394228688, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260923.g62364cb20", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260923.g62364cb20", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-23T01:17:02Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T01:24:23Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* Feat/gemini 3.8 flash 3.5 flash lite by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29443\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260922.gd5b3e3acc...v0.62.0-nightly.20260923.g62364cb20"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0", "id": 395156363, "tag_name": "v0.61.0", "name": "Release v0.61.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-23T23:50:59Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T23:59:15Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* Changelog for v0.60.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29251\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.61.0-nightly.20260908.gc647533d6 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29254\n* Changelog for v0.59.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29253\n* fix(core): preserve explicit versioned Flash model IDs by @SandyTao520 in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29252\n* fix(core): prevent indirect prompt injection via build file modifications and untrusted flags by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29250\n* fix(sandbox): harden filesystem boundaries and isolate runtime state by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29214\n* fix(core): ensure AgentLoopContext properties are preserved across object spread by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29335\n* fix(patch): cherry-pick 62364cb to release/v0.61.0-preview.0-pr-29443 to patch version v0.61.0-preview.0 and create version 0.61.0-preview.1 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/ge"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-preview.1", "id": 395124155, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-preview.1", "name": "Release v0.61.0-preview.1", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-23T22:44:36Z", "published_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:10Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(patch): cherry-pick 62364cb to release/v0.61.0-preview.0-pr-29443 to patch version v0.61.0-preview.0 and create version 0.61.0-preview.1 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29455\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.61.0-preview.0...v0.61.0-preview.1"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260922.gd5b3e3acc", "id": 393397893, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260922.gd5b3e3acc", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260922.gd5b3e3acc", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-22T01:20:19Z", "published_at": "2026-09-22T01:33:34Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): normalize proxy-agent esbuild interop for environment proxy resolution by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29401\n* fix(cli): emit tool_call update prior to request_permission in ACP mode by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29439\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260921.gcfbcaa8df...v0.62.0-nightly.20260922.gd5b3e3acc"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260921.gcfbcaa8df", "id": 392643029, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260921.gcfbcaa8df", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260921.gcfbcaa8df", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-21T01:24:56Z", "published_at": "2026-09-21T01:32:58Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260920.gcfbcaa8df...v0.62.0-nightly.20260921.gcfbcaa8df"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260920.gcfbcaa8df", "id": 392274660, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260920.gcfbcaa8df", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260920.gcfbcaa8df", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-20T01:19:17Z", "published_at": "2026-09-20T01:25:39Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260919.gcfbcaa8df...v0.62.0-nightly.20260920.gcfbcaa8df"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260919.gcfbcaa8df", "id": 391873086, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260919.gcfbcaa8df", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260919.gcfbcaa8df", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-19T01:18:24Z", "published_at": "2026-09-19T01:25:15Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* chore/release: bump version to 0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29383\n* fix(core): synchronize ConPTY process exit lifecycle and harden PTY output finalization by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29379\n* fix(cli): suppress uncaught AbortError logs during request cancellation by @urielefrenvirtusa in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29343\n* fix(core,cli): improve terminal buffer memory management and format Windows diagnostic paths by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29380\n* fix(vscode-ide-companion): preserve terminal focus when closing diff tabs by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29378\n* fix(core): update auth error documentation link to valid anchor and add fallback (#26140) by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29377\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79...v0.62.0-nightly.20260919.gcfbcaa8df"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79", "id": 391154887, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-18T01:17:01Z", "published_at": "2026-09-18T01:23:37Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): retain oauth refresh token on refresh and make credential deletion idempotent by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29339\n* fix(ui): guard against negative layout dimensions in border rendering by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29347\n* test(integration): deflake run_shell_command and file-system-interactive tests by @DavidAPierce in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29185\n* fix(core): improve PTY file descriptor cleanup and execution lifecycle management by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29340\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260917.g6a466a7e2...v0.62.0-nightly.20260918.g9450ade79"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260917.g6a466a7e2", "id": 390374594, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260917.g6a466a7e2", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260917.g6a466a7e2", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-17T01:19:00Z", "published_at": "2026-09-17T01:25:44Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.62.0-nightly.20260916.g6a466a7e2...v0.62.0-nightly.20260917.g6a466a7e2"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.62.0-nightly.20260916.g6a466a7e2", "id": 389578816, "tag_name": "v0.62.0-nightly.20260916.g6a466a7e2", "name": "Release v0.62.0-nightly.20260916.g6a466a7e2", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-16T01:21:27Z", "published_at": "2026-09-16T01:28:53Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): ensure AgentLoopContext properties are preserved across object spread by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29335\n* fix(a2a-server): add early return on unsupported store in tasks metadata endpoint by @jesussamuel-byte in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29334\n* Changelog for v0.61.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29344\n* Changelog for v0.60.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29345\n* fix(core,acp): format MCP tool call titles as structured signatures and segregate explanations by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29341\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.62.0-nightly.20260915.gae28844fb by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29346\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.61.0-nightly.20260915.g9c1b0a610...v0.62.0-nightly.20260916.g6a466a7e2"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-preview.0", "id": 389453413, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-preview.0", "name": "Release v0.61.0-preview.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-15T20:14:56Z", "published_at": "2026-09-15T20:22:07Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* Changelog for v0.60.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29251\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.61.0-nightly.20260908.gc647533d6 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29254\n* Changelog for v0.59.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29253\n* fix(core): preserve explicit versioned Flash model IDs by @SandyTao520 in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29252\n* fix(core): prevent indirect prompt injection via build file modifications and untrusted flags by @villahernandez-coder in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29250\n* fix(sandbox): harden filesystem boundaries and isolate runtime state by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29214\n* fix(core): ensure AgentLoopContext properties are preserved across object spread by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29335\n\n## New Contributors\n* @villahernandez-coder made their first contribution in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29250\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/comp"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-nightly.20260915.g9c1b0a610", "id": 388810555, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-nightly.20260915.g9c1b0a610", "name": "Release v0.61.0-nightly.20260915.g9c1b0a610", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-15T01:20:53Z", "published_at": "2026-09-15T01:28:16Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.61.0-nightly.20260914.g9c1b0a610...v0.61.0-nightly.20260915.g9c1b0a610"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.60.0", "id": 389459337, "tag_name": "v0.60.0", "name": "Release v0.60.0", "draft": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2026-09-15T20:24:23Z", "published_at": "2026-09-15T20:31:02Z", "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(core): improve destination validation and connection routing in web fetch utilities by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29120\n* fix(core): enforce RFC 9207 issuer identification in MCP OAuth flow by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29117\n* chore(release): bump version to 0.60.0-nightly.20260901.g0bd1d4397 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29162\n* Changelog for v0.58.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29161\n* fix(cli): isolate temporary directory for macOS Seatbelt sandbox by @jvargassanchez-dot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29171\n* feat(extensions): harden path resolution and boundary validation in extension loader by @diegogodinezr in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29169\n* Changelog for v0.59.0-preview.0 by @gemini-cli-robot in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29159\n* fix(core): sanitize and remove hardcoded Google CrUX API key in chrome-devtools-mcp by @amelidev in https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/pull/29158\n* fix(extensions): prompt for con"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-nightly.20260914.g9c1b0a610", "id": 388102758, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-nightly.20260914.g9c1b0a610", "name": "Release v0.61.0-nightly.20260914.g9c1b0a610", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-14T01:32:01Z", "published_at": "2026-09-14T01:45:58Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.61.0-nightly.20260913.g9c1b0a610...v0.61.0-nightly.20260914.g9c1b0a610"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-nightly.20260913.g9c1b0a610", "id": 387758581, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-nightly.20260913.g9c1b0a610", "name": "Release v0.61.0-nightly.20260913.g9c1b0a610", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-13T01:22:27Z", "published_at": "2026-09-13T01:29:27Z", "body": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/compare/v0.61.0-nightly.20260912.g9c1b0a610...v0.61.0-nightly.20260913.g9c1b0a610"}, {"html_url": "https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/releases/tag/v0.61.0-nightly.20260912.g9c1b0a610", "id": 387415269, "tag_name": "v0.61.0-nightly.20260912.g9c1b0a610", "name": "Release v0.61.0-nightly.20260912.g9c1b0a610", "draft": false, "prerelease": true, "created_at": "2026-09-12T01:18:24Z", "publi